        "detailed_description": "<h1>News – January 18, 2026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Notice] Linux &amp; Steam Deck Compatibility Confirmed</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello, this is the developer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have verified the stability of our game on <strong>Linux and Steam Deck</strong> environments. Here are the details regarding gameplay and controller support:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Testing Details]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Confirmed to run perfectly using <strong>Proton Experimental</strong> on Linux.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> The game <strong>natively supports standard controllers (such as Xbox controllers)</strong> without the need for Steam Input. Simply plug in your controller and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck:</strong> Users can enjoy a smooth experience on Steam Deck by enabling the same Proton settings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux and Steam Deck users can now play with confidence. Thank you for your support!</p></p><br><h1>Update – January 15, 2026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New: Hints added for floors 1, 2, and 3.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Drip… drip… drip…</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each time I shut my eyes, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>the dripping sound worms its way around my ears.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>That sound is driving me to the edge, night after night.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please… someone set me free…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tipsy Jaewook and his friends, spurred on by a creepy rumor, decide to check out the abandoned school on the hill… and what awaits them there is…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Solve puzzles and uncover hidden clues to escape the abandoned school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Discover environmental mysteries, untold stories, and choices that shape the outcome.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Drip… drip… drip…</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each time I shut my eyes, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>the dripping sound worms its way around my ears.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>That sound is driving me to the edge, night after night.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please… someone set me free…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tipsy Jaewook and his friends, spurred on by a creepy rumor, decide to check out the abandoned school on the hill… and what awaits them there is…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Solve puzzles and uncover hidden clues to escape the abandoned school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✦ Discover environmental mysteries, untold stories, and choices that shape the outcome.</p>",
